'''R2-N3''' was an [[R2-series astromech droid]]<ref name="BMF" /> that was stationed onboard the [[Naboo Royal Starship]]. During the [[Invasion of Naboo]], [[Monarch of Naboo|Queen]] [[Padmé Amidala Naberrie|Padmé Amidala]] and others attempted to break through the [[blockade]] surrounding the [[Naboo|planet]]. R2-N3 was deployed onto the hull of the [[Starship|ship]] when the [[Deflector shield generator|shield generator]] was damaged, but was quickly shot down by [[Trade Federation]] [[Lucrehulk-class LH-3210 cargo freighter|battleships]].<ref name="Ep1" />

